jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.31~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * A linked clone could not have been snapshotted or renamed. Whether a
    volume was a base image was decided by whether its name starts with
    'base-', and a linked clone is named base-100-disk-0/vm-101-disk-0 - it
    starts with 'base-' while being the least base-like volume on the
    storage. PVE would have refused 'qm snapshot' on any linked clone with
